OL,3,GNEWSAArrests made after couple and two
OL,4,Achildren killed in arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai (Irish police) have arrested a
OL,7,Fman aged in his 20s and a woman in her
OL,8,F30s in connection with a suspected
OL,9,Farson attack which killed four family
OL,10,Fmembers in Waterford.
OL,12,FThey are currently being held in a
OL,13,Fstation in the east of the Republic of
OL,14,FIreland.
OL,16,FKim English, Philip English and two of
OL,17,Ftheir children - nine-year-old Jayden
OL,18,Fand 12-year-old Callum - died after
OL,19,Ftheir home in Birch Avenue, on the
OL,20,Foutskirts of Waterford was set on fire
OL,21,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
